{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Up is a fast-paced vertical climbing game where you race against time through traps, moving platforms, and tricky obstacles. With simple controls but challenging levels, the game offers multiple modes such as Time Trial, Endless Climb, and Challenge Mode. Compete on global leaderboards and win exclusive prizes, unlock skins to customize your climber, and enjoy quick gameplay sessions perfect for short or long runs. The dynamic soundtrack builds intensity as you climb higher, pushing you to dodge, react, and reach new heights with every run.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3923000?t=1759096198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923000/657c15f9ddcc53fe0572c7cc1a4eaf9476d9c381/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759096198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923000/b709c8ce05b2a90eea02e5425695b2e150382923/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759096198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923000/b709c8ce05b2a90eea02e5425695b2e150382923/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759096198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twin Up is a fast-paced vertical climbing game where you race against time through traps, moving platforms, and tricky obstacles. With simple controls but challenging levels, the game offers multiple modes such as